NOTE:Hi there. I'm an actor and steel-certified fight choreographer with 18 years of experience— live steel performances\, stunt work\, and stage combat— and ~10 years ago I started focusing it in on film. Medieval fantasy heart\, born in Texas\, and a passion for any story with a real character arc and something to redeem. Experienced horseman. I thrive on organized sets where everyone has a specific job\, and Yeshua is my King so I bring His work ethic to every one of them.
